[Submission_1.Objectives]
Destroy the enemy defenses.
[Submission_1.Description]
While retreating, German troops formed up along a new defensive line in the area of Yadromino. You need to destroy these enemy defenses in order to continue your advance further toward Volokolamsk.

Your order is to:
- Destroy the enemy defenses.
[Submission_1.Success]
Your order has been fulfilled! You destroyed the enemy’s defense.
[Submission_1.Failed]
You failed to fulfill your task! Your troops were defeated.
[Submission_2.Objectives]
